# ── Java / Maven ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.nar
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar
*.log
*.ctxt
.mtj.tmp/
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*
target/
